      "writtenOn": "2020-07-24T19:29:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Tested waddledee and I believe the ANX7447 driver will need to use a non-cached CC status.  We never seem to be getting an update on unplug and the port gets stuck as Attached.SRC forever.  Since waddledoo tested fine, this is likely just a quirk of the ANX TCPC.  \n\nWe have a different TCPC on draw* that I\u0027ll be curious to try when my board gets back from re-work.",
      "parentUuid": "d7cd64dc_fa3cba55",
      "revId": "6338073cd94b4d304019c19a287dbfc16d4b4607",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
