      "writtenOn": "2020-07-24T22:18:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good catch - during first boot up, it\u0027s initialized to zero and the TCPC should be guaranteed to generate an CC_STATUS change int.  However, during sysjump or reboot conditions, it\u0027s possible that the TCPC has not been reset. Added code to the tcpci_tcpm_init() to always read CC_STATUS.",
